  "method_note": "Reads the three controllers and seven markets that #1748/#1750 left unread. The factory's marketInitCodeHash and controllerInitCodeHash are immutable (set once in the constructor from type(WildcatMarket).creationCode / type(WildcatMarketController).creationCode and never updatable), so V1 has exactly one market template and one controller template for its entire life: there is no historical implementation epoch to bind beyond the single one #1748 already reproduced. Chain reads used cast 1.7.1 and direct JSON-RPC against https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com, cross-checked against https://rpc.mevblocker.io and https://eth.blockscout.com/api/v2 for each address's creator, creation transaction, deployment block/hash/timestamp and eth_getCode. Compiled templates and immutableReferences came from the same factory Sourcify stdJsonInput #1748 pinned (sha256 dbeb245c5fc0a44f8ca7d001ddf801ec00176e838eae9487c8d65f2b9bdc8706), recompiled with solc 0.8.22+commit.4fc1097e (solc-js) and widened outputSelection to emit evm.deployedBytecode.object and evm.deployedBytecode.immutableReferences for WildcatMarket and WildcatMarketController.",
